# Reviewed exceptions for cohesive type groups whose split would obscure one module boundary.
multiple-public-types | src/binding.rs | Pending binding states and their one-shot definition form one internal registration model.
multiple-public-types | src/builder.rs | The definition trait, builder, replacement record, and construction state form one registration lifecycle boundary.
multiple-public-types | src/graph.rs | Binding positions, resolved requests, graph state, and edges are one private validation representation.
multiple-public-types | src/managed.rs | Lifecycle errors and managed cleanup actions form one public lifecycle API and share private action state.
multiple-public-types | macros/src/ir.rs | MacroKind, Declaration, and the declaration IR types form one private cross-expander representation model.
multiple-public-types | macros/src/parse.rs | RawDeclaration, RawOption, and RawValue form one parser output model for attribute syntax.
